WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:04.490
Previously on Smallville, we've come from the 31st century.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:06.490
We are the Legion.

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.490
Arrow, Canary, Impulse.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:11.490
Watchtower is officially online.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:14.490
Pass Mercer, acting CEO of Luther Corp.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.490
You're my boss?

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.489
We'll always be there for each other.

00:00:17.489 --> 00:00:18.489
Forever.

00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:19.489
No!

00:00:19.489 --> 00:00:21.489
Hey, what do you think of someone else's side over my?

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.489
First, Clark, and then Davis?

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:26.489
I won't kill Clark if I'm with you.

00:00:26.489 --> 00:00:28.489
The darkness, it doesn't come out.

00:00:28.489 --> 00:00:30.489
When Chloe's around, she makes me human.

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:32.490
You need us.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.490
I always don't try and find us.

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:38.500
I will find a way to save you.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Look, Lex Linter's life.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.500
You're responsible for the explosion.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.500
You got good instincts, Jimmy.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.500
There's an opening on my staff and something tells me you'd be perfect for it.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.500
Say that Clark Kent, the unassuming journalist.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.500
Upside the shadow in his red and blue,

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.500
creating two completely separate identities.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.500
But I'm ready to tell the world my secret.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.500
You'll be the first to know.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.500
I'm only a phone call away.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.500
I destroy the Legion ring.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.500
Control.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Time is too dangerous.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.650
Be careful in the days ahead.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.650
There is a savior among us that until you fulfill your destiny,

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.650
he won't have his great challenge to overcome.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:16.650
I'm not some problem to be solved.

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.650
I get it. It's too early.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:25.560
Why are you so determined to see Davis Bloom die?

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.560
The entire civilization's survival depends on it.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.560
And now, the season finale of Smallville.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:52.909
Thanks for meeting me.

00:01:52.909 --> 00:01:55.909
Not the one who had to travel a thousand years to get here.

00:01:55.909 --> 00:01:57.909
Well, I just hope that I'm not too late.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:59.909
For what?

00:01:59.909 --> 00:02:00.909
The future.

00:02:00.909 --> 00:02:05.500
Now I know that any time we travel back,

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.500
we take the chance of disrupting fate.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.500
And to be honest with you, Cal, after coming back here and trying to change the future,

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.500
I might not have one to go back to.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.500
I don't understand.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.500
You said the future would be safe if we got rid of Brainiac.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:20.500
Yes.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.500
Everything is safe.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:25.500
Brainiac is gone.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:33.740
But so are you.

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:35.740
When you saved Chloe's life, you saved her connection.

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.740
saved her connection to Doomsday.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.740
She stopped you from sending him to the Phantom Zone.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.740
She made him invulnerable by trying to kill him with Kryptonite.

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:48.740
And now because of Chloe, you cannot defeat him.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:03:03.300
I never take back my choice to save her.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.300
I believe yours got a little scorched.

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:13.469
Use the ring.

00:03:13.469 --> 00:03:15.469
Send Doomsday to the future.

00:03:15.469 --> 00:03:17.469
The Legion's there and we are ready to fight him.

00:03:17.469 --> 00:03:21.360
The Legion didn't unleash Doomsday, I did.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.360
Calell!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.360
You need to understand that there is not

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:30.639
Nothing on this earth that will stop him from killing you.

00:03:30.639 --> 00:03:38.120
My father always told me I was sent here to save mankind.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:44.919
Maybe this is my true destiny.

00:03:44.919 --> 00:03:45.919
How much time do I have?

00:03:45.919 --> 00:03:50.770
Tomorrow is the day you die.

00:03:50.770 --> 00:04:55.870
Sleep deprivation, but I can't exactly see a toca-clad woman in those stars up there.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:11.629
Her daughter, Persephone, was taken by Hades to find her daughter.

00:05:11.629 --> 00:05:16.629
But when Hades offered Persephone, her chance at freedom,

00:05:16.629 --> 00:05:18.629
To everyone's surprise.

00:05:18.629 --> 00:05:34.920
Persephone chose to live underground.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:38.920
The place to slow down, built a life together.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:43.199
As long as we can keep the gods from hunting us.

00:05:43.199 --> 00:05:56.819
Tell me you have a lock on their location.

00:05:56.819 --> 00:05:59.819
We traced the radiation left on Bloom after he attacked Neutron,

00:05:59.819 --> 00:06:05.589
but we've got another problem.

00:06:05.589 --> 00:06:06.589
What the hell?

00:06:06.589 --> 00:06:12.360
Oh my God.

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:16.360
We heard an explosion, then the security cameras in power pulse.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.740
We thought a transformer had blown outside.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:20.740
The orb.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.740
Someone stole the orb.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.740
No one could have broken in here without...

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:26.740
You just said that the system went down.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:27.740
Only for a few seconds.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:36.350
But Miss Mercer, you should know that our security believes the door was blown off from the inside.

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:42.240
You have no idea how many lives are at stake.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:44.240
Find that orb.

00:06:44.240 --> 00:07:22.829
Chloe's missing with some beastie boy, and you're doing what exactly?

00:07:22.829 --> 00:07:29.259
No one wants to find Chloe more than I do.

00:07:29.259 --> 00:07:31.259
Except maybe me.

00:07:31.259 --> 00:07:33.259
Clark, I haven't slept in days and I have danged.

00:07:33.259 --> 00:07:36.259
and I am dangerously close to a Caffeine OD.

00:07:36.259 --> 00:07:48.910
I hadn't noticed.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:53.910
Do you want to at least tell me about this little Novelli you're working on that's so important?

00:07:53.910 --> 00:08:00.009
Great.

00:08:00.009 --> 00:08:06.269
Another ricochet off the impenetrable force field.

00:08:06.269 --> 00:08:26.819
Forget it.

00:08:26.819 --> 00:08:27.819
Hello.

00:08:27.819 --> 00:08:28.819
Miss Lee.

00:08:28.819 --> 00:08:33.950
It's you.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.299
I've been searching for your cousin, Chloe.

00:08:37.299 --> 00:08:44.509
I am going to find her.

00:08:44.509 --> 00:08:45.509
Do you even know she was missing?

00:08:45.509 --> 00:08:53.149
I've been keeping an eye on you.

00:08:53.149 --> 00:08:55.149
To be honest, I was...

00:08:55.149 --> 00:08:59.500
I was kind of hoping for that.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.500
But I didn't know how to call you,

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.500
and then now all of a sudden here you are out of nowhere to save the day,

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:11.590
and I just, I'm rambling again.

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:21.769
I don't know how I'll ever be able to repay you for this.

00:09:21.769 --> 00:09:29.820
You could do me a favor.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.820
I need you to publish a letter for me.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.820
What letter?

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:49.919
You're here, aren't you?

00:09:49.919 --> 00:09:54.259
You're not supposed to open it yet.

00:09:54.259 --> 00:10:04.850
Can I count on you to publish that letter if anything happens to me?

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:05.850
What do you mean goodbye?

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:11.419
Sometimes.

00:10:11.419 --> 00:10:13.419
we can't outrun our destiny.

00:10:13.419 --> 00:10:20.129
But I thought you were invincible.

00:10:20.129 --> 00:10:21.129
So did I.

00:10:21.129 --> 00:10:32.539
I want to meet you.

00:10:32.539 --> 00:10:34.539
I have to see your face.

00:10:34.539 --> 00:10:39.070
I have to see you.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.070
I want you to show me what you can't show anyone else.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.070
You can trust me, please.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:47.070
I'm sorry, that's not a good idea.

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.070
Look, you can come through this.

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.070
You have to.

00:10:51.070 --> 00:11:00.509
And when you do, how do you feel about phone booths?

00:11:00.509 --> 00:11:01.509
They're fine.

00:11:01.509 --> 00:11:05.509
Um, there's one on 4th in Maine.

00:11:05.509 --> 00:11:07.509
Let's say midnight.

00:11:07.509 --> 00:11:10.139
I'll be there.

00:11:10.139 --> 00:11:15.659
I hope you'll be there too.

00:11:15.659 --> 00:11:16.659
And thank you.

00:11:16.659 --> 00:11:21.190
If anyone can save Chloe.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:49.820
I know it's you.

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:50.820
What's the 911?

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:53.820
Thanks for meeting me.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.820
I thought Bart was supposed to be.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.820
President accounted for.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.820
Be able to get the schematics.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:08.539
What do you think?

00:12:08.539 --> 00:12:10.539
Geothermal facility care queen industry and Luther Corps.

00:12:10.539 --> 00:12:16.259
and Luther Corp.

00:12:16.259 --> 00:12:18.259
All right, what's with the black hole?

00:12:18.259 --> 00:12:19.259
Rock said nothing on the face of the Earth

00:12:19.259 --> 00:12:22.730
could destroy the beast.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:23.730
So let's put them under it.

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:28.419
The geothermal facility.

00:12:28.419 --> 00:12:31.419
Created one mile of tunnels beneath Earth's crust.

00:12:31.419 --> 00:12:35.419
So it's the final resting place for the Boney Space Invader.

00:12:35.419 --> 00:12:38.419
If I can manage to get him down there, can you access the detonators in the shaft?

00:12:38.419 --> 00:12:40.419
I can override it.

00:12:40.419 --> 00:12:43.419
Are we really going to bury him alive?

00:12:43.419 --> 00:12:44.419
Not all of them.

00:12:44.419 --> 00:12:46.419
There's still a side of Davis worth saving.

00:12:46.419 --> 00:12:53.980
Bart, this is for you.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:59.009
for you.

00:12:59.009 --> 00:13:00.009
It's a bad rock.

00:13:00.009 --> 00:13:02.450
Careful with that.

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:03.450
It's a very special meteor rock.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:06.450
You can split the Kryptonian from the human side of Davis.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.450
What if that doesn't work?

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:15.230
What if you end up unleashing a monster that's unstoppable that doesn't have a conscience?

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:18.230
This is the only option.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:22.230
Well, what about the option to get him rid of the serial killer before he has a chance to beast out?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:26.789
You never wanted to admit it.

00:13:26.789 --> 00:13:28.789
There is a darker side to humanity.

00:13:28.789 --> 00:13:34.440
I know there is.

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:36.440
I'm looking at it right now.

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:37.440
Not everyone's worth saving.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:41.139
We need to take care of Davis Bloom.

00:13:41.139 --> 00:13:43.139
And by take care of you mean murder?

00:13:43.139 --> 00:13:48.139
Okay, dude, you guys got like some, uh, some serious tension going on here.

00:13:48.139 --> 00:13:50.139
Oli, what's he talking about?

00:13:50.139 --> 00:13:57.860
Oliver crossed the line.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:58.860
He killed Lex Luthor.

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:03.200
A big mistake.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:41.019
You're not one of us anymore.

00:14:41.019 --> 00:14:42.019
Have the decryption key?

00:14:42.019 --> 00:14:43.019
Yeah.

00:14:43.019 --> 00:14:45.019
Well, I hope you have better like than I did.

00:14:45.019 --> 00:14:58.700
Call me when you have Chloe's location.

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:00.700
Jimmy, stepped on my hand.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.700
Next time, don't leave your hand on the floor under our desk in an office.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:05.200
you're not supposed to be in.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:08.200
I'm sorry, did I just get a lecture from Jimmy Olson?

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.200
Who are you talking to?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.200
No one.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.200
Lovis, what are you doing here?

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.200
I'm looking for Chloe and Davis.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.200
The head of Tessa's security has been staked out

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.200
at the Talon apartment.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.200
Creepy, but telling.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:24.200
The only problem is her 8-gig minib brain is encrypted.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:34.639
Not anymore.

00:15:34.639 --> 00:15:36.639
Tess is definitely tracking Chloe and Davis.

00:15:36.639 --> 00:15:38.639
Most of this is from a couple days ago,

00:15:38.639 --> 00:15:47.299
but if I can just get in there, Bingo.

00:15:47.299 --> 00:15:51.299
It looks like Chloe and Davis are on the outskirts of Edge City and so am I.

00:15:51.299 --> 00:16:06.360
Don't take your eyes off and let me know if they move.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.360
Tess.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:11.360
Lex already tried to break down the technology of that orb.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.360
Lex knew that orb wasn't from this earth.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:17.360
It called to me.

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:22.360
There's life inside it that can't be released until the traveler kills the beast.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:17:32.589
Sorry, Clark, we couldn't risk losing you.

00:17:32.589 --> 00:17:56.220
It won't kill you.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:59.220
This is just get your ego out of the weight so we can do what needs to be done.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:19.240
Don't do this.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.240
I kind of miss the maid costume.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:24.279
I've stopped cleaning up after you.

00:18:24.279 --> 00:18:26.279
You could have fooled me.

00:18:26.279 --> 00:18:30.529
I expect from my reporters a little better reconnaissance,

00:18:30.529 --> 00:18:34.529
but then again, the bar's always been a little bit lower for you, hasn't it?

00:18:34.529 --> 00:18:38.529
Look, I know family loyalty means nothing to you.

00:18:38.529 --> 00:18:40.529
But I would do anything to find Chloe.

00:18:40.529 --> 00:18:42.529
And if that means you need to fire me,

00:18:42.529 --> 00:18:44.529
hold the trigger.

00:18:44.529 --> 00:18:46.529
I plan to.

00:18:46.529 --> 00:18:48.529
But this actually has very little to do with Chloe.

00:18:48.529 --> 00:18:52.349
You saw it, didn't you?

00:18:52.349 --> 00:18:53.349
You saw it, didn't you?

00:18:53.349 --> 00:18:59.750
Seriously, you have a significant efficiency of pronoun modifiers going on.

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:04.210
Lois, where's the orb?

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.210
What orb?

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:07.210
The alien technology from my vault.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.210
Oh, that orb.

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:21.170
I guess asking for severances out of the question.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:23.170
I didn't want this.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.170
No.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:28.170
You just want to take over the world with some alien nation.

00:19:28.170 --> 00:19:30.170
I am trying to save the world.

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:32.170
What's wrong with Greenpeace?

00:19:32.170 --> 00:20:33.240
What's going on?

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.240
Sorry about the Trank, beautiful.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:38.240
It kind of snuck up on you, super fast.

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:47.089
Where's Clark?

00:20:47.089 --> 00:20:49.089
He found a way to kill him, didn't you?

00:20:49.089 --> 00:20:52.089
And Clark wouldn't go along with it?

00:20:52.089 --> 00:20:56.089
No. He wanted to play devil's advocate with the actual devil.

00:20:56.089 --> 00:20:59.089
Split the kryptonian from the human.

00:20:59.089 --> 00:21:00.089
Black kryptonite.

00:21:00.089 --> 00:21:05.079
Only one glitch in his plan. The whole beast part.

00:21:05.079 --> 00:21:08.079
Last time we checked, he couldn't control his thorny or alter ego.

00:21:08.079 --> 00:21:13.079
No, but I can. As long as I stay with him, he doesn't change.

00:21:13.079 --> 00:21:14.079
Please don't do this.

00:21:14.079 --> 00:21:16.079
to him.

00:21:16.079 --> 00:21:17.079
They have to.

00:21:17.079 --> 00:21:22.180
Chloe, it's not working anymore.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.180
Chloe, wait.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:29.990
Chloe, you're not working.

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:32.990
Davis, just focus on me, okay?

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:35.990
We'll get through this together, just like we always have.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:37.990
I'm sorry.

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:39.990
It's too late.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:41.990
You can go now.

00:21:41.990 --> 00:23:35.789
You're here one second and then you're not?

00:23:35.789 --> 00:23:40.480
You took a bullet, and the next day you were fine.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:41.480
I mean, it's like you're so.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:46.880
some kind of super guy.

00:23:46.880 --> 00:23:55.529
Jimmy, I am the red-blue blur.

00:23:55.529 --> 00:23:59.680
You were right.

00:23:59.680 --> 00:24:01.680
About me and about Davis.

00:24:01.680 --> 00:24:05.279
You were the only person to put it all together.

00:24:05.279 --> 00:24:08.809
I'm sorry that I lied to you.

00:24:08.809 --> 00:24:22.079
I was so right.

00:24:22.079 --> 00:24:24.079
Jimmy, I need your help.

00:24:24.079 --> 00:24:26.079
Do you still have that wedding gift?

00:24:26.079 --> 00:24:28.079
The one for Chloe that you said you never gave to her?

00:24:28.079 --> 00:24:32.089
I couldn't bring myself to get rid of it.

00:24:32.089 --> 00:24:34.089
Alright, well, I need you give it to her now.

00:24:34.089 --> 00:24:37.630
And whatever happens to me, you need to make sure

00:24:37.630 --> 00:24:39.630
that Davis and Chloe are safe.

00:24:39.630 --> 00:24:42.420
Davis?

00:24:42.420 --> 00:24:46.329
Do you trust me?

00:24:46.329 --> 00:24:49.670
Always.

00:24:49.670 --> 00:24:50.670
It's okay.

00:24:50.670 --> 00:25:19.190
Chloe?

00:25:19.190 --> 00:25:20.190
Hey.

00:25:20.190 --> 00:25:21.190
Are you okay?

00:25:21.190 --> 00:25:22.190
I think so.

00:25:24.190 --> 00:25:25.190
What happened here?

00:25:25.190 --> 00:25:28.190
Exactly what you want, Clark?

00:25:28.190 --> 00:25:32.190
I split him. I split him from the beast.

00:25:32.190 --> 00:25:34.190
Where did he go?

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:58.460
I'll get him back here.

00:25:58.460 --> 00:26:00.460
But I still need you to detonate the explosives.

00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:02.460
Clark, you get him down that tunnel.

00:26:02.460 --> 00:26:03.460
We'll take care of the rest.

00:26:03.460 --> 00:26:05.460
Can I trust you?

00:26:05.460 --> 00:26:06.460
Yes.

00:26:06.460 --> 00:28:13.640
Clark said you'd bring us somewhere safe.

00:28:13.640 --> 00:28:15.640
you'd bring us somewhere safe.

00:28:15.640 --> 00:28:17.640
What is this place?

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:22.539
It's your wedding present.

00:28:22.539 --> 00:28:26.289
What it was?

00:28:26.289 --> 00:28:27.289
I was.

00:28:27.289 --> 00:28:30.289
I was going to give it to you after the reception, but...

00:28:30.289 --> 00:28:34.630
My wedding prison?

00:28:34.630 --> 00:28:35.630
I need some work.

00:28:35.630 --> 00:28:46.809
I know. I saw us here, you know.

00:28:46.809 --> 00:28:49.809
Starting our life together.

00:28:49.809 --> 00:28:51.809
Taking something that the rest of the world had forgotten about

00:28:51.809 --> 00:28:55.250
and making it ours.

00:28:55.250 --> 00:29:07.619
You can see all of Metropolis from here.

00:29:07.619 --> 00:29:12.569
From anywhere in the city, you can spot this place.

00:29:12.569 --> 00:29:15.569
I thought that no matter where you were, you could look

00:29:15.569 --> 00:29:19.200
look up and you can see our home.

00:29:19.200 --> 00:29:29.359
You can see me watching over you.

00:29:29.359 --> 00:29:37.279
How you do it.

00:29:37.279 --> 00:29:41.319
You always seem to come through.

00:29:41.319 --> 00:29:43.319
You're always there doing the right thing,

00:29:43.319 --> 00:29:45.319
saying the right words.

00:29:45.319 --> 00:29:48.319
Jimmy, there's so much that I want to tell you, but...

00:29:48.319 --> 00:29:54.839
I know about Clark.

00:29:54.839 --> 00:29:56.839
What exactly do you know?

00:29:56.839 --> 00:30:01.339
The... what? I saw him.

00:30:01.339 --> 00:30:05.339
And I saw what he can do who he is.

00:30:05.339 --> 00:30:09.769
And now I see all kinds of things.

00:30:09.769 --> 00:30:13.630
I see what you have sacrificed for him.

00:30:13.630 --> 00:30:17.000
for him, for everyone, really.

00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:23.259
That's the reason I went with Davis to protect him.

00:30:23.259 --> 00:30:25.259
That's the only reason.

00:30:25.259 --> 00:30:27.259
It all makes sense now.

00:30:27.259 --> 00:30:32.259
But the way I see it, you are as much of a hero as he's ever been.

00:30:32.259 --> 00:30:37.259
What you've gone through, we've risked.

00:30:37.259 --> 00:30:39.259
What I've lost.

00:30:39.259 --> 00:30:41.259
I've lost so much.

00:30:41.259 --> 00:30:44.569
The only thing I really miss is you.

00:30:44.569 --> 00:30:48.269
Well, now you found me again.

00:30:48.269 --> 00:31:03.359
I'm so sorry I left Jimmy, but I promise I never left you.

00:31:03.359 --> 00:31:48.819
You put that down.

00:31:48.819 --> 00:31:50.819
How could you do this?

00:31:50.819 --> 00:32:06.640
I thought I did.

00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:12.609
But really what I wanted to do was save you.

00:32:12.609 --> 00:32:22.200
The save!

00:32:22.200 --> 00:32:50.789
You're gonna be okay.

00:32:50.789 --> 00:33:49.880
He restoreth my soul.

00:33:49.880 --> 00:33:52.880
He leadeth me in the paths of righteousness

00:33:52.880 --> 00:33:54.880
for his namesake.

00:33:54.880 --> 00:33:57.880
Ye, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death,

00:33:57.880 --> 00:33:59.880
I will fear no evil,

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:01.880
for thou art with me.

00:34:01.880 --> 00:34:05.700
Henry James Olson,

00:34:05.700 --> 00:34:06.700
rest in peace.

00:34:07.700 --> 00:34:56.170
Hey, you must be Jimmy's little brother.

00:34:56.170 --> 00:35:11.019
Well, I think that this belongs to you.

00:35:11.019 --> 00:35:18.239
He would have wanted you to have it.

00:35:18.239 --> 00:35:19.239
Who knows?

00:35:19.239 --> 00:35:21.239
Maybe someday you'll follow in his footsteps.

00:35:21.239 --> 00:37:02.059
You survived the geothermal explosion.

00:37:02.059 --> 00:37:03.059
Before Dina, press the button.

00:37:03.059 --> 00:37:16.329
For the blast, but not fast enough to save anyone else.

00:37:16.329 --> 00:37:38.469
They searched everywhere. There's no sign of loss.

00:37:38.469 --> 00:37:41.469
I saw someone tacking her photo on a missing person's port.

00:37:41.469 --> 00:37:49.880
And I keep thinking that maybe, you know, maybe I haven't.

00:37:49.880 --> 00:38:02.530
Lost everyone.

00:38:02.530 --> 00:38:04.530
You were there today, Clark.

00:38:04.530 --> 00:38:07.389
Weren't you?

00:38:07.389 --> 00:38:11.150
I really needed you.

00:38:11.150 --> 00:38:16.980
Why didn't you come?

00:38:16.980 --> 00:38:17.980
The reason Jimmy's dead.

00:38:17.980 --> 00:38:21.800
Love it was right.

00:38:21.800 --> 00:38:27.550
I put humanity on a pedestal.

00:38:27.550 --> 00:38:36.440
It wasn't the Kryptonian beast that killed Jimmy.

00:38:36.440 --> 00:38:37.440
It was the human.

00:38:37.440 --> 00:38:43.659
I was standing right here, Clark.

00:38:43.659 --> 00:38:50.199
I know full well who killed Jimmy.

00:38:50.199 --> 00:38:57.119
It's a place, Chloe.

00:38:57.119 --> 00:39:01.940
Just get rid of it.

00:39:01.940 --> 00:39:04.940
Just walk away and don't look back.

00:39:04.940 --> 00:39:06.940
You don't get it.

00:39:06.940 --> 00:39:08.940
Clark, Jimmy is here.

00:39:08.940 --> 00:39:11.940
He's watching over me.

00:39:11.940 --> 00:39:13.940
He knew me so well.

00:39:13.940 --> 00:39:19.179
He knew this place would be perfect.

00:39:19.179 --> 00:39:21.179
Jimmy wanted to know that no matter where I was in the city,

00:39:21.179 --> 00:39:23.179
I could look up here and see this beacon.

00:39:23.179 --> 00:39:33.860
Dina, Oliver and Bart all disappeared.

00:39:33.860 --> 00:39:36.860
Maybe it's up to us to bring them back home.

00:39:36.860 --> 00:39:37.860
Home?

00:39:37.860 --> 00:39:42.360
They don't have a home.

00:39:42.360 --> 00:39:45.369
The way that sounds.

00:39:45.369 --> 00:39:51.559
I've always tried to forget I was an alien.

00:39:51.559 --> 00:40:00.349
Or a creature.

00:40:00.349 --> 00:40:03.880
I've always tried to pretend I was human.

00:40:03.880 --> 00:40:04.880
I was raised as believer.

00:40:04.880 --> 00:40:05.880
It was my contonian part.

00:40:05.880 --> 00:40:07.880
that was dangerous, Chloe, but I was wrong.

00:40:07.880 --> 00:40:13.309
It's my human side.

00:40:13.309 --> 00:40:18.599
It's the side that gets attached.

00:40:18.599 --> 00:40:21.599
The side that makes decisions based on emotions.

00:40:21.599 --> 00:40:27.119
That's my enemy.

00:40:27.119 --> 00:40:28.119
Davis proved that to me.

00:40:28.119 --> 00:40:31.119
So because of some psychopath you're going to cut the rest of us

00:40:31.119 --> 00:40:32.119
out of your life?

00:40:32.119 --> 00:40:38.980
Clark, human emotion is what made you the hero that you are today.

00:40:38.980 --> 00:40:41.980
They're what's stopping me from being the hero I could be.

00:40:41.980 --> 00:40:46.190
It's what the world needs now.

00:40:46.190 --> 00:40:51.449
What do you say?

00:40:51.449 --> 00:40:52.449
Clark Kent is dead.

00:40:52.449 --> 00:40:54.449
Thank you.

